wb-mqtt-dauerhaft-pro (1.0.0) stable; urgency=medium

  * Initial MVP release: Wiren Board MQTT driver for Dauerhaft PRO RS-485
    actuators, written in Python. Drives the actuators through wb-mqtt-serial's
    port/Load RPC (so they share the RS-485 bus with regular Modbus devices) and
    publishes each one as an MQTT device configured via wb-mqtt-confed.
  * Supported controls: Up, Down, Stop, and changing the device RS-485 address.

 -- Ilya Tikhonyuk <ilya.tikhonyuk@wirenboard.com>  Mon, 06 Jul 2026 12:00:00 +0500
